.spec/architecture.md-14-    UI[Relux app] <--> NE
.spec/architecture.md-15-    NE == authenticated SSH lanes ==> SSHD[User-owned sshd]
.spec/architecture.md-16-    SSHD --> TCP[Destination TCP services]
.spec/architecture.md:17:    SSHD --> Relay[relux-relay over stdio]
.spec/architecture.md:18:    Relay --> UDP[Destination UDP services and DNS]
