.spec/relay-protocol.md:114:- Oversized UDP datagrams fail with a bounded error; they are never split by the
.spec/relay-protocol.md:115:  relay protocol.
.spec/relay-protocol.md-116-- Queue saturation drops datagrams and increments counters; it does not block the
.spec/relay-protocol.md-117-  SSH event loop with unbounded retry.
.spec/relay-protocol.md-118-- DNS associations receive latency priority but no protocol privilege.
.spec/relay-protocol.md:119:- Relay exit, framing failure, or lane-A loss closes all relay associations and
.spec/relay-protocol.md-120-  enters degraded mode until a clean handshake succeeds.
